    {
      "id": "b8cd6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "See the University Catalog for the full listing of degree requirements for this major. See the Admissions website for transfer admission requirements/information. See the International Education &amp; Global Engagement website for international transfer academic qualifications. See the Academic Advising Programs website for information on California Promise and Associate Degree for Transfer. See the University Catalog for Credit by Exam information (AP, IB, CLEP).",
