      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "The BA in Public Administration is an approved match to: Law, Public Policy, and Society (AA-T) Political Science (AA-T)",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The BA in Public Administration is an approved match to:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Law, Public Policy, and Society (AA-T)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Political Science (AA-T)</span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
