      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "General Education courses are recommended, but not required, to support the student in this major. See Group 1: Recommended General Education Courses, for the selection of Mathematical Concepts and Quantitative Reasoning (2) courses.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">General Education courses are recommended, but not required, to support&nbsp;the student in this major. See Group 1: Recommended General Education Courses, for the selection of Mathematical Concepts and Quantitative Reasoning (2) courses.</span></p>"
